    "body": "Re-flagged ready at 3e6398e2 (test only). The new test `a_click_in_the_frame_the_pane_hides_misses_the_hidden_draft` pins the pre-dock `disarm_all`.\n- **How it reproduces the gap:** the press lands while Properties shows and the +Y Two-points pick is armed. In the single next frame, a View-door toggle brings Machines to the front, and the release is queued in that same frame. The viewport handles the release inside the dock, before the post-dock sweep runs.\n- **With the pre-dock branch disabled:** the hidden draft takes a second point and the test fails. With it restored, all 6 `setup_picks_disarm` tests pass, and clippy is clean.",
